\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Main result.} (a) Geometric mean MASE across 5 seeds (error bars: cross-seed std). HD10 (green) significantly outperforms baseline and both capacity controls. Duplicate channel (red) is worse than baseline. (b) Pooled win rates (485 comparisons). HD10 wins 67.8\% against baseline, 69.3\% against duplicate, and 66.6\% against zero.\relax }}{7}{figure.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:main}{{2}{7}{\textbf {Main result.} (a) Geometric mean MASE across 5 seeds (error bars: cross-seed std). HD10 (green) significantly outperforms baseline and both capacity controls. Duplicate channel (red) is worse than baseline. (b) Pooled win rates (485 comparisons). HD10 wins 67.8\% against baseline, 69.3\% against duplicate, and 66.6\% against zero.\relax }{figure.caption.20}{}}
